d what Pacifica would look like  all grown up she might look the same but  this version of the diva is definitely a  lot more feisty and we have a feeling  she always gets what she wants even as  an adult do you think her and dipper  have actually developed a romantic  interest at some point in their lives  the girls and here are the three girls  of gravity falls Pacifica the most  popular girl in town Mabel's most  cheerful ones and Wendy who will talk  more about  just a little bit wild cobra girl from  deviantART also beautifully reimagined  what these three would look like all  grown up the illustration is pretty  spot-on  they're definitely older but it looks  like they all kept their original  personalities  Wendy still looks cool Pacifica still  looks like a diva and Mabel is just as  fabulous we wonder if the three would  get along more as grown-ups or what  Pacifica still make Mabel her biggest  rival who just can't seem to get along  Wendy and dipper get ready because this  is one of the cutest illustrations ever  we all know Wendy and dipper are a true  OTP although it's clear that Wendy is  almost too old for dipper and the  different tries way too hard to get the  girl but you are totally adorable in one  of our favorite cartoon couples winter  made an eleven from deviantART did a  fantastic job at reimagining what these  two it'd look like when they are  slightly older check it out it looks  like Dipper finally outgrew Wendy and  the two are truly adorable together and  from what it looks like they're madly in  love just like it should be even though  this show is over we're still rooting  for these two soos speaking of favorite  characters how could we possibly forget  about SIDS he's pretty mysterious and  even the intro the show labels him as a  huge question mark but apart from being  an unusual character soos is incredibly  sweet and friendly to everyone even  though he can be just a little bit  clueless this is what he'd look like as  a slightly 